        <ul>
          <li>Chat tab in the Daily window — auto-growing composer, slimmer header, more room for the thread.</li>
          <li>New Netbird mode — manage peers, people, roles, notes and SSH right from Daily.</li>
          <li>Editorial Plan briefing with a menu-bar tether glow.</li>
          <li>Pause background activity (dormant) mode to idle the app on demand.</li>
          <li>Shows the real app name throughout instead of a hardcoded "Claude Bar" label.</li>
